id: impediment
name: Impediment
kind: condition
description: >
  A catch-all combat condition that reflects a worsened mental state.
text: >
  Do not apply your Tier of Power Extra Dice (this only applies to a single
  instance of Tier of Power Extra Dice - meaning that if you apply multiple
  instances through effects, you only remove a single instance of them). If you
  do not possess Tier of Power Extra Dice, reduce your Combat Rolls by 2(bT)
  instead.
  Impediment has a unique interaction with the Superior State. If you are in
  the Superior State while suffering from the Impediment Combat Condition,
  ignore the effects of the Impediment Combat Condition, but also ignore the
  first effect of the Superior State.

---

# The Superior State cancels this outright. The other half of that bargain -
# Superior also losing its first effect - is written in the Superior State,
# since that is the effect being given up.

[passive]
if (!inState("Superior")) {
    if (dice.extra.instances > 0) {
        dice.extra.instances -= 1;
    } else {
        combatRolls -= 2(bT);
    }
}
